I was in a shop, when I discovered a glitch.  I accidentally zapped
myself with a wand of make invisible.  Since I didn't have a way to
get out, I decided to pelt the shopkeeper with force bolts.
Amazingly, the shopkeeper zapped me with his wand of striking, yet he
did not move to melee the wizard.  This made it easy to kill the
shopkeeper.

So, to do this glitch, first:
1. become invisible in a shop
2. use ranged attacks on the shopkeeper, while staying invisible
3. laugh as the shopkeeper only does ranged attacks back



